ialogs":[{"nodeId":711490101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":3039214682,"text":"今年の予定は問題ないはず…ふぅ…今回は、刻晴様に直接確認していただかなくても大丈夫そうです…","nextNodeIds":[711490116]},{"nodeId":711490116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":211884258,"text":"うっ！そんなこと考えちゃダメ…私は福の神、私は福の神、私は福の神…","nextNodeIds":[711490103]},{"nodeId":711490103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":995249258,"text":"#えっと、{M#君}{F#あなた}は…","nextNodeIds":[711490117]},{"nodeId":711490117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":2364516922,"text":"私は福の神です！","nextNodeIds":[711490118,711490119]},{"nodeId":711490118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1274507850,"text":"そ、そうだね…","nextNodeIds":[711490120]},{"nodeId":711490120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":194200570,"text":"#おや？{NICKNAME}さんでしたか。来るのがあなたって分かっていたら、あんなに決まり文句を覚えなくて良かったのに…","nextNodeIds":[711490121]},{"nodeId":711490121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":3393560490,"text":"どうやら、璃月の海灯祭を満喫しにいらしたんですね？","nextNodeIds":[711490122]},{"nodeId":711490122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":3315507026,"text":"ちょうどいいところに来てくれました。ほら、周りの雰囲気をご覧ください。去年の海灯祭よりも賑やかでしょう？","nextNodeIds":[711490123,711490124]},{"nodeId":711490123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3985884970,"text":"海灯祭はいつも…","nextNodeIds":[711490125]},{"nodeId":711490125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":3060310074,"text":"ええ、その通りです。「霄灯は高く高く舞い上がる」と言いますからね。何事も常に上を目指すべきでしょう。","nextNodeIds":[711490126]},{"nodeId":711490126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":2184119634,"text":"あっ、せっかくのお祭りなのに、こんな真面目な話はよしましょう。さあさあ、お祭りの見どころをご案内しますよ。","nextNodeIds":[711490127]},{"nodeId":711490127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":3540618506,"text":"えーと、そうですね…あっ、そうだ！海灯祭と言えば、まずは霄灯を飛ばさないと。","nextNodeIds":[711490128]},{"nodeId":711490128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":1432741098,"text":"そうそう、あと今年は璃月港のあちこちに「吉兆の宝樹」を設置しました。その枝を切って整えてあげると、中にある「吉語銭」を貰える、といったものです。","nextNodeIds":[711490129]},{"nodeId":711490129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":3454300090,"text":"全部でいくつだったか…えーっと…たしか二十一本のはず。","nextNodeIds":[711490130]},{"nodeId":711490130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":2835725954,"text":"そして…実はこの近くにも「吉兆の宝樹」が一本ありまして。興味があれば手入れしてあげてください、そう難しくありませんので。","nextNodeIds":[711490131]},{"nodeId":711490131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":372023498,"text":"最後に…もしよろしければ、そこの「掲示板」も見ていただけますか。ほら、すぐ横のです。","nextNodeIds":[711490132]},{"nodeId":711490132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":3465927554,"text":"近年、海灯祭には外国から多くの観光客が訪れるようになったため、総務司はそういった方々に向けて「掲示板」を設置しました。","nextNodeIds":[711490102]},{"nodeId":711490102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":1482726674,"text":"もし何か問題やトラブルがありましたら、「掲示板」にお書きください。","nextNodeIds":[711490133]},{"nodeId":711490133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":3003784746,"text":"私たち総務司は、海灯祭に来てくださった皆さまに満足してもらえるよう、全力を尽くす所存です！","nextNodeIds":[711490134,711490135]},{"nodeId":711490134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1832684282,"text":"さすが総務司だね。","nextNodeIds":[711490136]},{"nodeId":711490136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":3182100594,"text":"当然のことです！","nextNodeIds":[711490137]},{"nodeId":711490137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":4051877554,"text":"#そういえば、たしか{NICKNAME}さんは写真を撮るのがお得意でしたよね。","nextNodeIds":[711490138,711490139]},{"nodeId":711490138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":577981330,"text":"いくらかね。","nextNodeIds":[711490140]},{"nodeId":711490140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":3798086546,"text":"あはは、ご謙遜なさらず。実は…ちょっとしたお願いがありまして。","nextNodeIds":[711490141]},{"nodeId":711490141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":4102881018,"text":"簡単なことなのでご安心を！観光客の「記念写真」を撮るだけですから。","nextNodeIds":[711490142]},{"nodeId":711490142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":3898470682,"text":"もともとは撮影スタッフを何人か雇って、「記念撮影」の対応をしてもらう予定だったんですが、今年は観光客が予想以上に多くて、人手が全然足りなくなってしまいまして…","nextNodeIds":[711490143]},{"nodeId":711490143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":1742991906,"text":"#今から新しいカメラマンを雇うのも間に合わないので、頼れるのはもう{NICKNAME}さんしかいません！","nextNodeIds":[711490144]},{"nodeId":711490144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":2854108402,"text":"お願いします！観光客の皆さまのため、海灯祭のため、璃月のために！どうか！","nextNodeIds":[711490145,711490146]},{"nodeId":711490145,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3730697514,"text":"そういうことなら任せて！","nextNodeIds":[711490147]},{"nodeId":711490147,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":1428983642,"text":"#おお！さすが{NICKNAME}さん！では、お客さまの名前と予約場所をお伝えしますね。","nextNodeIds":[711490148]},{"nodeId":711490148,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":533923610,"text":"それでは、よろしくお願いします。あなたのお手伝いがあれば、今年の海灯祭はきっと完璧なものになるでしょう！","nextNodeIds":[711490149]},{"nodeId":711490149,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","textMapHash":3907887074,"text":"あと、こちらの霄灯をどうぞ。海灯祭を祝して！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":711490146,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1371494474,"text":"海灯祭のためなら！","nextNodeIds":[711490147]},{"nodeId":711490139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3415274874,"text":"まったく得意じゃないけど…","nextNodeIds":[711490140]},{"nodeId":711490135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":452713434,"text":"さすが璃月…","nextNodeIds":[711490136]},{"nodeId":711490124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2514588698,"text":"前の年よりすごくなってる…","nextNodeIds":[711490125]},{"nodeId":711490119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1299852058,"text":"縁起の良さそうな服だね…","nextNodeIds":[711490120]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7114901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30924"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7114901],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30924,"speakerName":"萍渓","count":26},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":11}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[171149],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2852219342,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[71168],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Liyue_71149/Q7114901","ANDJNFLIDI